{"id":"8593ee4c3e2d37f1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Kolmogorov Complexity","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity — ZFC Recursion4 Kolmogorov Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity — ZFC Recursion4 Kolmogorov Complexity","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity — ZFC Recursion4 Kolmogorov Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"743918416d7084a1\" href=\"?note=743918416d7084a1\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,M,p,q,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(U,M,p,q,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m,c\\in\\omega\">\\(k,m,c\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (finite binary strings)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\\)</span> (prefix-free-machine predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"743918416d7084a1\" href=\"?note=743918416d7084a1\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (auxiliary predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}description\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash \\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(p)=\\sigma\\land|p|=k)\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=\\sigma\\to k\\leq|q|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}description\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash \\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(p)=\\sigma\\land|p|=k)\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=\\sigma\\to k\\leq|q|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}optimal\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine}\\vdash \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega})\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(M,\\sigma,m)\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\land k\\leq m+c))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}optimal\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine}\\vdash \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega})\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(M,\\sigma,m)\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\land k\\leq m+c))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}complexity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}complexity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relative predicate defines the least description length only when a description exists, avoiding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing\">\\(\\min\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Optimality states the invariance theorem's additive domination property against every prefix-free machine; the main predicate is therefore genuine prefix-free Kolmogorov complexity relative to the chosen optimal machine.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"743918416d7084a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"743918416d7084a1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S$ (prefix-free-machine predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,M,p,q,\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"k,m,c\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}description\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash \\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\land\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(p)=\\sigma\\land|p|=k)\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\;(U(q)=\\sigma\\to k\\leq|q|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}optimal\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine}\\vdash \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall M\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq2^{<\\omega})\\to\\exists c\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(M,\\sigma,m)\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\land k\\leq m+c))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}complexity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4KolmogorovComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{OptimalPrefixFreeMachine}_S(U)\\land\\mathrm{PrefixDescriptionComplexity}_S(U,\\sigma,k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\min\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2599,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-kolmogorov-complexity]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","743918416d7084a1","5045d216c83e75cb"]}